; One variable: a Sprite2D that draws one frame of a ViewportTexture. The target holds four 4 px
; columns, red, green, blue and yellow, one frame each. Magnified at scale 16, the filter blends
; each frame's edge texels into its neighbour's, which Godot reads past the frame.

